component so that \([P,Q]=1\); this does not change any support, degree, corner,
minimality, or chain datum used here.

Define \(C\), \(R\), \(\alpha\), and \(\beta\) as in Section 0 and set

\[
 (f,g)=C\circ(P,Q)\circ R.
